            <div class="imagemeta col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <h3>Summary</h3>

                <p>I worked with Google on AI implementation for an Android app used by its developers for bug reporting.</p> 
              <p>Our work was able to significantly reduce waste on a long, tedious process and free up a truly unbelievable amount of developer time. </p>
              <p>The project contract doesn't allow me to share details, but here’re some extremely nonspecific points about my contributions.</p>

            </div>

            <div class="images col-md-6">
                <img class="image" src="/images/projects/google/bugs_3up.jpg" />
            </div>

